Upstream-Name: kidux-module-blockly-games
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/google/blockly-games
Source: https://github.com/othermore/kidux
Comment: The games under upstream/ are built by ci/build-upstream.sh from the
 commit of https://github.com/google/blockly-games that upstream.toml names
 (docs/dev/packaging.md, "Programs built at development time"), with the
 third-party code its Makefile names: Blockly, Ace, SoundJS and
 JS-Interpreter, each under its own licence.

